# 🔐 Security Considerations

The project uses Django's built-in security mechanisms, including:

- CSRF protection
- Django authentication
- Server-side form validation
- ORM-based database queries
- User authentication checks
- Ownership-based listing management
- Environment variables for sensitive configuration

Production deployment will additionally use environment-specific security settings such as:

```text
DEBUG=False
ALLOWED_HOSTS
CSRF_TRUSTED_ORIGINS
Secure cookies
HTTPS
Security headers
```

